01:31:18,291 --> 01:31:20,166
Kenapa sih lo nggak benci aja sama gue?

723
01:31:20,291 --> 01:31:21,625
Gue benci kok sama lo.

724
01:31:22,833 --> 01:31:24,125
Tapi gue juga sayang.

725
01:31:25,166 --> 01:31:27,125
Biar gimana pun lo tetep adik gue.

726
01:31:29,708 --> 01:31:32,000
Gue nggak mau marah sama lo,
Anders.

727
01:31:32,375 --> 01:31:36,333
- Gue cuma pengen lo
jadi lebih baik.
- Udah benci aja kenapa sih!

728
01:31:36,458 --> 01:31:37,833
Benci aja sama gue bangsat.

729
01:31:39,208 --> 01:31:40,500
Itu kan yang lo mau.

730
01:31:40,625 --> 01:31:41,916
Gue nggak mau...

731
01:31:43,458 --> 01:31:44,625
Masa sih.

732
01:31:44,791 --> 01:31:46,708
Lebih gampang kan buat lo kalau dibenci.

733
01:31:48,208 --> 01:31:49,791
Gue nggak tahu maunya apa.

734
01:31:51,458 --> 01:31:52,916
Gimana kalau lo jadi saudara yang bener?

735
01:32:08,291 --> 01:32:09,416
- Gala!
- Singkirin dia dari gue!

736
01:32:09,541 --> 01:32:11,000
Kayaknya lengan gue patah nih!

737
01:32:11,125 --> 01:32:12,208
Waylen!

738
01:32:12,916 --> 01:32:14,916
Gala, ini aku!

739
01:32:15,041 --> 01:32:17,750
Harusnya dia nggak bisa gitu!
Dia nggak boleh nyerang manusia!

740
01:32:17,875 --> 01:32:19,416
Ini aku, Waylen!

741
01:32:19,541 --> 01:32:21,958
- Waylen!
- Kamu inget nggak?

742
01:32:22,250 --> 01:32:23,291
Waylen!

743
01:32:23,875 --> 01:32:25,458
Kamu inget nggak?

744
01:32:29,708 --> 01:32:30,791
Waylen.